2026-09-23T08:31:05.3564291Z     Features
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3564389Z     --------
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3564470Z     
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3564904Z     - Detailed info on failing `assert statements <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/assert.html>`_ (no need to remember ``self.assert*`` names)
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3564996Z     
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3565157Z     - `Auto-discovery
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3565489Z       <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/goodpractices.html#python-test-discovery>`_
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3565609Z       of test modules and functions
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3565695Z     
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3565933Z     - `Modular fixtures <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/fixtures.html>`_ for
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3566097Z       managing small or parametrized long-lived test resources
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3566194Z     
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3566438Z     - Can run `unittest <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/unittest.html>`_ (or trial)
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3566542Z       test suites out of the box
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3566634Z     
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3566738Z     - Python 3.10+ or PyPy3
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3566817Z     
2026-09-23T08:31:05.3567243Z     - Rich plugin architecture, with over 1300+ `external plugins <https://docs.pytest.org/en/latest/reference/plugin_list.html>`_ and thriving community
